[1879354497]={[1]="Key of the Forgotten";[2]="This key was used to seal away an archive in Khazad-dûm, but the holder of the key was slain and the key he bore was taken into Mordor. Forgotten, the dwarves that were sealed away survived as long as they could, but came in time to a sad end. You unlocked the door, and in so doing cleansed the key's corruption. Elrond has imbued it with the Light of Eärendil, and believes it will help you banish the shadows of Mordor.";[3]=49;[4]=4;[5]=3;[6]=false;[7]=false;};
[1879354498]={[1]="Brooch of Bone";[2]="This brooch of bone belonged to a Lossoth man named Oiva, and it was gifted to you by his widow Pinja when you cleansed it of the corruption that had fastened to it in Mordor. Elrond has imbued it with the Light of Eärendil, and believes it will help you banish the shadows of Mordor.";[3]=49;[4]=4;[5]=3;[6]=false;[7]=false;};
[1879354499]={[1]="Seed of Defiance";[2]="The seeds once contained in this pouch were entrusted to Trotsiv of the Earth-kin, and he protected them from those who would do them harm. Though the pouch was brought into Mordor, and corruption ensnared it, the seeds within could not be ruined or destroyed, and now you have cleansed it of that evil. Elrond has imbued it with the Light of Eärendil, and believes it will help you banish the shadows of Mordor.";[3]=49;[4]=4;[5]=3;[6]=false;[7]=false;};
